        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Paul\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/48/5862_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Paul:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"mention\">@jffdouganOK</span>, if we do they are burried in our spare parts zone and not accessible at this time. That zone is on the \"organize soon!\" list, so if we find any extras of those (or any other exciting stuff people might want!), I'll put them up on the web store for cheap <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I hope to not miss that. I love getting spare pieces, and I love getting them extra cheap even more.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also, may I say I'm being blown away by how good Spirit Island is doing. You guys are looking at a 4th wave of the game going out it is pretty much constantly sold out. That is amazing.</p>",
