        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-11T21:42:04.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm actually relieved to hear that.&nbsp; I want to see the Kickstarter, but 1) development on the RPG is already underway, and launching the Kickstarter earlier isn't going to change that (unless &gt;G starts going bankrupt without those funds, which, hahaha, Spirit Island at least), and 2) waiting until after OblivAeon has 100% shipped to backers is a really good idea so the ill will from its enormous delay can at least partially get swept away.</p>",
