        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-12-12T13:53:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"MindWanderer\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/48/4816_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> MindWanderer:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm actually relieved to hear that.&nbsp; I want to see the Kickstarter, but 1) development on the RPG is already underway, and launching the Kickstarter earlier isn't going to change that (unless &gt;G starts going bankrupt without those funds, which, hahaha, Spirit Island at least), and 2) waiting until after OblivAeon has 100% shipped to backers is a really good idea so the ill will from its enormous delay can at least partially get swept away.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>As a backer in the 8K range, so long as they've at least started shipping OblivAeon before they start the KS, I'm happy with the timing.</p>",
