        "id": 210503,
        "name": "Inanevan",
        "username": "Inanevan",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/i/2acd7d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-11T12:15:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just recently receive spirit island as a Christmas gift and am absolutely in love with the game.  Unfortunately,  my group is usually more than 4 people and I would really like to buy the game mat so that I may support up to 6 players. we have already played a few times learning the games,  we find ourselves ruining out of explorers a lot. Where can I buy more explorer pieces, and the play mat? Since the expansion is still backed at the moment (I’m waiting for when you guys have the promo and expansion back in stock!).</p>",
