        "created_at": "2018-01-11T13:34:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Both of these items are available on the Greater than Games store. Search for \"Spirit Island playmat\" and \"Champions of the Dahan token bundle\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The expansion is great, but doesn't have things for playing with multiple players.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>You could also buy another copy of the core game and acquire extra wooden disks in different colors from somewhere.</p>",
